<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A0101008" svcinfotypenbr = "02" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Vehicle Identification Number
</title>
<ptxt>
The number (1) is inscribed on the right dash side of front panel in engine compartment.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
The number (2) is also attached on the left side of cowl top panel depending on vehicle specification.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A010006.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.493mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "149"/>
</figure>
<ptxt>
The label (3) inscribed with the number is also attached on rear floor panel depending on vehicle specification.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A010011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.615mm" ver = "01" gw = "214" gh = "141"/>
</figure>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
